prompt:
Given the outputs from structure-auditor, schema-validator, and scrub-checker, produce a final push verdict.

Inputs:
- Structure audit: {{structure-auditor.status}} — missing: {{structure-auditor.missing_files}}
- Schema sync: {{schema-validator.status}} — mismatches: {{schema-validator.mismatches}}
- Scrub: {{scrub-checker.status}} — leaks: {{scrub-checker.leaks}}

Verdict rules:
- BLOCK_PUSH if scrub-checker.status == "leaked" (data leak is always blocking)
- BLOCK_PUSH if structure-auditor is missing LICENSE or README.md (non-negotiable OSS hygiene)
- WARN_ONLY if schema-validator.status == "mismatch" (desync is a warning, not a blocker)
- WARN_ONLY if structure-auditor is missing CHANGELOG.md or .gitignore only
- PASS_PUSH if all checks are clean

Return: { verdict: "PASS_PUSH" | "WARN_ONLY" | "BLOCK_PUSH", reasons: string[], recommended_actions: string[] }
